INSERT INTO `catalogue_products` VALUES (177,45,'SPRAY - 9\"','BL-121000',NULL,13999,NULL,'L660 W355 H745 mm','<p>The <strong>SPRAY – 9\"</strong> is a modern, floor-mounted one-piece western commode crafted in a high-glossy black finish. Designed with a sleek, contemporary square silhouette, it brings a bold, luxury aesthetic to contemporary bathroom spaces.</p><p>Equipped with a soft-closing seat and efficient flushing mechanism, this toilet delivers strong, thorough cleansing and quiet operation while maintaining an eco-friendly design.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Model Name:</strong> SPRAY – 9\"</li><li><strong>Product Code:</strong> BL 121000</li><li><strong>Type:</strong> One-Piece Western Toilet / Commode</li><li><strong>Finish &amp; Color:</strong> High-Glossy Black</li><li><strong>Trap Type:</strong> S-Trap</li><li><strong>Roughing-In Distance:</strong> 225 mm (9 Inches)</li><li><strong>Features:</strong> Soft Closing Seat</li><li><strong>Eco Attributes:</strong> Eco-Friendly Design</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,1,'none','colour',1,0,'2026-09-22 09:44:59','2026-09-24 05:49:03'),(178,45,'ADNOX - 9\"','BL-121101',NULL,16499,NULL,'L665 W365 H745 mm','<p>The <strong>X-TRAL ADNOX – 9\"</strong> is a modern, floor-mounted <strong>one-piece western commode</strong> crafted in a high-gloss black finish. Designed with a sleek, contemporary square silhouette, it brings a bold, luxury aesthetic to contemporary bathroom spaces.</p><p>Equipped with advanced flushing technology, this toilet features a <strong>syphonic 6D and vortex flushing system</strong> that delivers strong, thorough cleansing while ensuring low water consumption.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><h3><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Brand:</strong> X-TRAL</li><li><strong>Model Name:</strong> ADNOX – 9\"</li><li><strong>Product Code:</strong> BL 121101</li><li><strong>Type:</strong> One-Piece Western Toilet / Commode<