onic flushing mechanism and a soft-closing seat, this toilet delivers strong, thorough cleansing and quiet operation while ensuring low water consumption.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Model Name:</strong> SPRAY</li><li><strong>Product Code:</strong> BL 131003</li><li><strong>Type:</strong> Wall-Hung Western Toilet / Commode</li><li><strong>Finish &amp; Color:</strong> High-Glossy Black</li><li><strong>Trap Type:</strong> P-Trap</li><li><strong>Roughing-In Distance:</strong> 180 mm</li><li><strong>Flushing Mechanism:</strong> Syphonic Flushing</li><li><strong>Features:</strong> Soft Closing Seat</li><li><strong>Eco Attributes:</strong> Eco-Friendly &amp; Water-Saving Design</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,1,'none','colour',2,0,'2026-09-22 09:52:34','2026-09-24 05:49:27'),(181,45,'TOZZO','BL-124001',NULL,5500,NULL,'L540 W395 H140 mm','<p>The <strong>TOZZO</strong> is a modern tabletop wash basin crafted in a high-glossy black finish. Designed with a sleek, rectangular silhouette featuring smooth, contoured edges, it brings a bold, luxury aesthetic to contemporary bathroom spaces. </p><p>Featuring a deep basin structure, it delivers splash-free usage, easy maintenance, and enhanced durability while complementing modern countertop setups.</p><p> </p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Model Name:</strong> TOZZO </li><li><strong>Product Code:</strong> BL 124001 </li><li><strong>Type:</strong> Tabletop Wash Basin </li><li><strong>Finish &amp; Color:</strong> High-Glossy Black </li><li><strong>Mounting Type:</strong> Above Counter / Tabletop</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,1,'none','colour',4,0,'2026-09-22 09:52:34','2026-09-24 05:45:15'),(182,45,'SPRAY','BL-124002',NULL,5500,NULL,'L505 W390 H150 mm','<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">The </span><strong style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">SPRAY</strong><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"> is a