0,'2026-09-23 06:54:47','2026-09-25 05:22:23'),(513,74,'SQUAR DRAIN VITEL',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'','<p>The <strong>SQUAR DRAIN VITEL – 6 X 6</strong> is a large-format square floor drain cover featuring a chevron-inspired geometric grating design. Designed with a broad surface area, it efficiently handles high-volume water drainage in spacious shower zones.</p><p>Featuring durable stainless steel material and precision cutouts, it ensures smooth water clearance and long-lasting durability.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Model Name:</strong> SQUAR DRAIN VITEL – 6 X 6</li><li><strong>Product Code:</strong> GR 601602</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 6 × 6 Inches</li><li><strong>Type:</strong> Vitel Pattern Square Floor Drain</li><li><strong>Finish &amp; Color:</strong> High-Glossy Stainless Steel</li><li><strong>Mounting Type:</strong> Floor-Embedded</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,1,'size','colour',319,0,'2026-09-23 06:54:47','2026-09-25 05:23:13'),(514,74,'SQUAR DRAIN TILE INSERT',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'','<p>The <strong>SQUAR DRAIN TILE INSERT – 5 X 5</strong> is an invisible square floor drain designed to integrate seamlessly into tile flooring. Designed with a tile-in tray, it allows matching floor tiles to be fitted directly onto the cover for a minimalist, luxury aesthetic.</p><p>Featuring high-flow peripheral drainage gaps and a heavy-duty stainless steel frame, it delivers rapid water drainage and a smooth floor finish.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Model Name:</strong> SQUAR DRAIN TILE INSERT – 5 X 5</li><li><strong>Product Code:</strong> GR 501507</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 5 × 5 Inches</li><li><strong>Type:</strong> Tile Insert Square Floor Drain</li><li><strong>Finish &amp; Color:</strong> Stainless Steel / Tile-In Design</li><li><strong>Mounting Type:</strong> Floor-Embedded</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,1,'size','colour',318,0,'2026-09-23 06:54:47','2026-09-