ossy chrome with a square silhouette, it positions the shower directly overhead for a immersive rainfall experience.</p><p><br></p><p>Featuring robust threading, it ensures leak-proof attachment and vertical alignment.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><p><br></p><p>• Model Name: <strong>SQUARE CEILING SHOWER ARM</strong></p><p>• Product Code / Size Options:</p><p>• SAC 290909: 9 Inches</p><p>• SAC 290912: 12 Inches</p><p>• Type: Ceiling-Mounted Square Shower Arm</p><p>• Finish &amp; Color: High-Glossy Chrome</p><p>• Mounting Type: Ceiling-Mounted</p>',NULL,1,'size','colour',330,0,'2026-09-23 07:11:12','2026-09-25 05:40:42'),(518,75,'ROUND ARM - 9\"',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'','<p>The <strong>ROUND ARM - 9\"</strong> is a classic curved shower mounting arm finished in high-glossy chrome. Designed with a smooth arch bend, it elevates and positions round overhead shower heads at an ideal angle.</p><p><br></p><p>Featuring universal threaded ends, it offers quick installation and durable rust protection.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><p><br></p><p>• Model Name: <strong>ROUND ARM - 9\"</strong></p><p>• Product Code: SA 270909</p><p>• Type: Curved Round Shower Arm</p><p>• Finish &amp; Color: High-Glossy Chrome</p><p>• Mounting Type: Wall-Mounted</p>',NULL,1,'size','colour',331,0,'2026-09-23 07:11:12','2026-09-25 05:40:56'),(519,75,'BRASS EXTENSION NIPPLE',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'','<p>The <strong>BRASS EXTENSION NIPPLE</strong> is a male-threaded plumbing connector crafted in solid brass. Designed to extend pipe connections out from wall surfaces for taps and shower fittings, it resolves depth alignment issues during installation.</p><p><br></p><p>Featuring heavy-duty threads and high burst pressure resistance, it ensures long-term leak-free reliability.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><p><br></p><p>• Model Name: <strong>BRASS EXTENSION NIPPLE</strong></p><p>• Product Code / Size Options:</p><p>• AD 110010: 1 Inch</p><p>• AD 110011: 1.5 Inches</p><p>• AD 110012: 2 Inches</p><p>• AD 110013: 2.5 Inches</p><p>• AD 110014: 3 Inches</p><p>• Type: Threaded Extension Nipple Fitting</p><p>• Material: Solid Brass</p>',NULL,1,'size','colour',332,0,'2026-09-23 07:11:12','2026-09-25 05:41:06'),(520,75,'EWC SS SCREW (HEAVY)',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'','<p>The <strong>EWC SS SCREW (HEAVY)</strong> is a heavy-gauge stainless steel floor screw set with wall plugs designed for fixing European Water Closets (EWC) to floor surfaces. Designed to keep toilets firmly anchored, it eliminates movement and wobbling.</p><p><br></p><p>Featuring rust-proof SS construction, it withstands moisture and aggressive cleaning chemicals.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><p><br></p><p>• Model Name: <strong>EWC SS SCREW (HEAVY)</strong></p><p>• Product Code: RB 115115</p><p>• Type: EWC Floor Fixing Screw Set</p><p>• Material: Heavy Stainless Steel (SS)</p>',NULL,1,'size','colour',336,0,'2026-09-23 07:11:12','2026-09-25 05:41:57'),(521,75,'WASH BASIN BOLT - SS (HEAVY)',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'','<p>The <strong>ASPIRO WASH BASIN BOLT - SS (HEAVY)</strong> is a heavy-duty stainless steel mounting bolt set designed for securing wash basins to wall structures. Supplied with durable wall plugs, washers, and nuts, it ensures firm, vibration-free anchorage.</p><p><br></p><p>Featuring high-grade stainless steel material, it offers superior load bearing and rust resistance.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><p><br></p><p>• Model Name: <strong>ASPIRO WASH BASIN BOLT - SS (HEAVY)</strong></p><p>• Product Code: RB 004105</p><p>• Type: Wash Basin Wall Mounting Hardware Set</p><p>• Material: Heavy Stainless Steel (SS)</p><p>• Includes: SS Bolts, Wall Anchors, Washers, Nuts</p>',NULL,1,'size','colour',333,0,'2026-09-23 07:11:12','2026-09-25 05:41:21'),(522,75,'7\" WASH BASIN BOLT - SS (EX-HEAVY)',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'','<p>Th