ild, it delivers long-lasting safety and strength.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><p><br></p><p>• Model Name: <strong>GRAB BAR MATT</strong></p><p>• Product Code / Size Options:</p><p>• GB 110109: 9 Inches</p><p>• GB 110112: 12 Inches</p><p>• GB 110115: 15 Inches</p><p>• GB 110118: 18 Inches</p><p>• GB 110124: 24 Inches</p><p>• Type: Bathroom Safety Grab Bar</p><p>• Finish &amp; Color: Satin Matt Stainless Steel</p><p>• Mounting Type: Wall-Mounted</p>',NULL,1,'size','colour',337,0,'2026-09-23 07:11:12','2026-09-25 05:42:40'),(525,75,'BRASS HEX NIPPLE',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'','<p>The <strong>BRASS HEX NIPPLE</strong> is a heavy-duty male-to-male threaded connector featuring a central hexagonal nut section for easy wrench tightening. Crafted in solid brass, it joins two female-threaded pipes or plumbing valves securely.</p><p><br></p><p>Featuring precision threads, it offers high pressure resistance and leak-proof jointing.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><p><br></p><p>• Model Name: <strong>BRASS HEX NIPPLE</strong></p><p>• Product Code: HN 110035</p><p>• Type: Hexagonal Threaded Nipple Connector</p><p>• Material: Solid Brass</p>',NULL,1,'size','colour',338,0,'2026-09-23 07:11:12','2026-09-25 05:42:57'),(526,75,'SS HEX NIPPLE',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'','<p>The <strong>SS HEX NIPPLE</strong> is a male-threaded pipe connector manufactured from high-grade stainless steel with a hexagonal center grip. Designed for joining internal pipe threads in plumbing systems, it guarantees maximum strength.</p><p><br></p><p>Featuring corrosion-resistant stainless steel, it is ideal for high-moisture sanitary environments.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><p><br></p><p>• Model Name: <strong>SS HEX NIPPLE</strong></p><p>• Product Code: HN 110030</p><p>• Type: Stainless Steel Hex Nipple Fitting</p><p>• Material: Stainless Steel (SS)</p>',NULL,1,'size','colour',339,0,'2026-09-23 07: