cise flow control cartridges, it provides reliable shutoff and long service life.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><p><br></p><p>• Model Name: <strong>ECO ANGLE COCK</strong></p><p>• Product Code: AD 110099</p><p>• Type: Angle Valve / Cock</p><p>• Finish &amp; Color: High-Glossy Chrome</p><p>• Mounting Type: Wall-Mounted</p>',NULL,1,'size','colour',341,0,'2026-09-23 07:11:12','2026-09-25 05:43:43'),(530,75,'FUSION ANGLE COCK',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'','<p>The <strong>FUSION ANGLE COCK</strong> is a contemporary angle valve featuring a sleek vertical lever handle and high-glossy chrome finish. Designed for reliable isolation of water supply connections, it coordinates seamlessly with modern bath fittings.</p><p><br></p><p>Featuring smooth quarter-turn operation, it prevents leaks and maintains consistent water flow.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><p><br></p><p>• Model Name: <strong>FUSION ANGLE COCK</strong></p><p>• Product Code: AD 110092</p><p>• Type: Angle Valve / Cock</p><p>• Finish &amp; Color: High-Glossy Chrome</p><p>• Mounting Type: Wall-Mounted</p>',NULL,1,'size','colour',342,0,'2026-09-23 07:11:12','2026-09-25 05:44:02'),(531,75,'CP FLANG (REGULAR)',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'','<p>The <strong>CP FLANG</strong> is a decorative wall rosette plate crafted in high-glossy chrome. Designed to conceal wall openings around exposed pipes, angle valves, or shower arms, it provides a clean, professional finish.</p><p><br></p><p>Featuring durable metal construction, it offers simple snap-fit installation and rust protection.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><p><br></p><p>• Model Name: <strong>CP FLANG</strong></p><p>• Product Code / Style Options:</p><p>• FL 001001: CP FLANG (REGULAR)</p><p>• FL 001002: CP FLANG (FLAT)</p><p>• Type: Decorative Wall Flange / Escutcheon Plate</p><p>• Finish &amp; Color: High-Glossy Chrome</p>',NULL,1,'size','colour',343,0,'2026-09-23 07: