rong>Material:</strong> Quartz Composite Granite </li><li><strong>Overall Size:</strong> 45\" × 20\" × 9\" </li><li><strong>Mounting Type:</strong> Topmount / Undermount</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,1,'color','colour',465,0,'2026-09-23 08:53:50','2026-09-25 09:27:26'),(664,88,'OPUS','VT-777333',NULL,44900,NULL,'','<p>The <strong>OPUS</strong> is a luxury wall-hung bathroom vanity unit designed with a contemporary minimal aesthetic. Crafted from High-Density High-Moisture Resistance (HDHMR) board, it features two smooth-pull main storage drawers paired with an integrated ceramic basin and a stylish LED mirror to elevate modern washroom spaces.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Model Name:</strong> OPUS</li><li><strong>Product Code:</strong> VT 777333</li><li><strong>Type:</strong> Wall-Hung Bathroom Vanity Set</li><li><strong>Material / Make:</strong> HDHMR (High-Density High-Moisture Resistance)</li><li><strong>Includes:</strong> Cabinet, Basin, LED Mirror</li><li><strong>Basin:</strong> 800 × 460 MM</li><li><strong>Cabinet:</strong> 787 × 455 MM</li><li><strong>LED Mirror:</strong> 800 × 460 MM</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,1,'none','colour',466,0,'2026-09-23 09:03:49','2026-09-25 09:30:44'),(665,88,'DYNA','VT-777222',NULL,37450,NULL,'','<p>The <strong>DYNA</strong> is a modular dual-cabinet vanity set designed for extended storage and modern bathroom layouts. Built using durable HDHMR material, it includes a wide floating main cabinet, a matching vertical side cabinet, a tabletop counter, and an illuminated circular LED mirror.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Model Name:</strong> DYNA</li><li><strong>Product Code:</strong> VT 777222</li><li><strong>Type:</strong> Modular Wall-Hung Vanity Set with Side Cabinet</li><li><strong>Material / Make:</strong> HDHMR (High-Density High-Moisture Resistance)</li><li><strong>Includes:</strong> Main Cabinet, Side Cabinet, Tabletop Counter, LED Mirror</li><li><strong>Cabinet:</strong> 900 × 480 MM</li><li><strong>Side Cabinet:</strong> 230 × 800 MM</li><li><strong>Table Top:</strong> 610 × 340 MM</li><li><strong>LED Mirror:</strong> 600 × 600 MM</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,1,'none','colour',467,0,'2026-09-23 09:03:49','2026-09-25 09:30:58'),(666,88,'TRENDY','VT-777666',NULL,41999,NULL,'','<p>The <strong>TRENDY</strong> is an architectural fluted-panel vanity unit engineered with premium slab tiles and HDHMR wood construction. Featuring a wall-mounted fluted cabinet, a contrast countertop, a counter-mounted bowl basin, and an elegant vertical oval mirror, it brings a high-end designer look to luxury bathrooms.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Model Name:</strong> TRENDY</li><li><strong>Product Code:</strong> VT 777666</li><li><strong>Type:</strong> Fluted Wall-Hung Vanity Set</li><li><strong>Material / Make:</strong> HDHMR &amp; Slab Tiles</li><li><strong>Includes:</strong> Cabinet, Slab Tiles Top, Table Top, Mirror</li><li><strong>Slab Tiles:</strong> 800 × 470 MM</li><li><strong>Cabinet:</strong> 790 × 440 MM</li><li><strong>Table Top:</strong> 325 × 450 MM</li><li><strong>Mirror:</strong> 600 × 900 MM</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,1,'none','colour',468,0,'2026-09-23 09:03:49','2026-09-25 09:31:12'),(667,88,'MARINA','VT-777444',NULL,21690,NULL,'','<p>The <strong>MARINA</strong> is a compact floor-standing bathroom vanity cabinet crafted from moisture-resistant HDHMR material. Designed with dual doors and solid legs for ground support, it comes complete with an integrated wash basin and a matching framed wall mirror for daily utility.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Model Name:</strong> MARINA</li><li><strong>Product Code:</strong> VT 777444</li><li><strong>Type:</strong> Floor-Standing Vanity Unit</li><li><strong>Material / Make:</strong> HDHMR (High-Density High-Moisture Resistance)</li><li><strong>Includes:</strong> Cabinet, Basin, Framed Mirror</li><li><strong>Basin:</strong> 600 × 460 MM</li><li><strong>Cabinet:</strong> 585 × 455 MM</li><li><strong>Mirror:</strong> 600 × 460 MM</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,1,'none','colour',469,0,'2026-09-23 09:03:49','2026-09-25 09:31:25'),(668,88,'WHITE DOVE','VT-777555',NULL,24990,NULL,'','<p>The <strong>WHITE DOVE</strong> is a modern vertical storage vanity combo featuring a ribbed fluted cabinet and a dedicated wall-mounted side cabinet. Crafted from moisture-resistant HDHMR board, it maximizes storage organisation with integrated drawers and matching mirror unit.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Model Name:</strong> WHITE DOVE</li><li><strong>Product Code:</strong> VT 777555</li><li><strong>Type:</strong> Wall-Hung Vanity Set with Storage Cabinet</li><li><strong>Material / Make:</strong> HDHMR (High-Density High-Moisture Resistance)</li><li><strong>Includes:</strong> Main Cabinet, Side Cabinet, Basin, Mirror</li><li><strong>Basin:</strong> 600 × 460 MM</li><li><strong>Cabinet:</strong> 585 × 455 MM</li><li><strong>Side Cabinet:</strong> 610 × 205 MM</li><li><strong>Mirror:</strong> 600 × 460 MM</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,1,'none','colour',470,0,'2026-09-23 09:03:49','2026-09-25 09:31:49'),(669,88,'OMEGA','VT-777888',NULL,15990,NULL,'','<p>The <strong>OMEGA</strong> is a floor-standing compact vanity cabinet featuring rich dark-wood textured drawer panels set in a white frame. Built using HDHMR material, it is designed with support legs, multiple storage compartments, a ceramic top basin, and a matching patterned wall mirror.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Model Name:</strong> OMEGA</li><li><strong>Product Code:</strong> VT 777888</li><li><strong>Type:</strong> Floor-Standing Compact Vanity Set</li><li><strong>Material / Make:</strong> HDHMR (High-Density High-Moisture Resistance)</li><li><strong>Includes:</strong> Cabinet, Basin, Mirror</li><li><strong>Basin:</strong> 360 × 500 MM</li><li><strong>Cabinet:</strong> 350 × 490 MM</li><li><strong>Mirror:</strong> 450 × 600 MM</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,1,'none','colour',471,0,'2026-09-23 09:03:49','2026-09-25 09:32:05'),(670,88,'OLIVE','VT-777000',NULL,12490,NULL,'','<p>The <strong>OLIVE</strong> is a space-saving wall-mounted vanity unit designed for compact powder rooms and modern bathrooms. Constructed from durable HDHMR board, it features a textured dark blue diagonal-slat door, an integrated ceramic sink basin, and a wall mirror.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Model Name:</strong> OLIVE</li><li><strong>Product Code:</strong> VT 777000</li><li><strong>Type:</strong> Compact Wall-Hung Vanity Set</li><li><strong>Material / Make:</strong> HDHMR (High-Density High-Moisture Resistance)</li><li><strong>Includes:</strong> Cabinet, Basin, Mirror</li><li><strong>Basin:</strong> 360 × 500 MM</li><li><strong>Cabinet:</strong> 350 × 490 MM</li><li><strong>Mirror:</strong> 450 × 600 MM</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,1,'none','colour',472,0,'2026-09-23 09:03:50','2026-09-25 09:32:19'),(671,88,'AQUA','VT-777777',NULL,12800,NULL,'','<p>The <strong>AQUA</strong> is a wall-hung compact vanity cabinet highlighted by natural wood-grain finish doors. Crafted from moisture-resistant HDHMR material, it features a single-door storage section, top wash basin, and a matching accent wall mirror for compact bathroom spaces.</p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Model Name:</strong> AQUA</li><li><strong>Product Code:</strong> VT 777777</li><li><strong>Type:</strong> Compact Wall-Hung Vanity Set</li><li><strong>Material / Make:</strong> HDHMR (High-Density High-Moisture Resistance)</li><li><strong>Includes:</strong> Cabinet, Basin, Mirror</li><li><strong>Basin:</strong> 360 × 500 MM</li><li><strong>Cabinet:</strong> 350 × 490 MM</li><li><strong>Mirror:</strong> 450 × 600 MM</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,1,'none','colour',473,0,'2026-09-23 09:03:50','2026-09-25 09:32:41'),(672,88,'ASCENT','VT-777111',NULL,15490,NULL,'','<p>The <strong>ASCENT</strong> is a floor-mounted compact vanity cabinet styled with dark blue diagonal texture panels and a sleek white frame. Built with durable HDHMR material, it combines multi-tier drawer/door storage, a top basin, and a clean rectangular wall mirror.</p><p><strong>Key Features &amp; Specifications</strong></p><p><strong><span class=\"ql-cursor\">﻿</span></strong></p><ul><li><strong>Model Name:</strong> ASCENT</li><li><strong>Product Code:</strong> VT 777111</li><li><strong>Type:</strong> Floor-Standing Compact Vanity Set</li><li><strong>Material / Make:</strong> HDHMR (High-Density High-Moisture Resistance)</li><li><strong>Includes:</strong> Cabinet, Basin, Mirror</li><li><strong>Basin:</strong> 360 × 500 MM</li><li><strong>Cabinet:</strong> 350 × 490 MM</li><li><strong>Mirror:</strong> 450 × 600 MM</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,1,'none','colour',474,0,'2026-09-23 09:03:50','2026-09-25 09:32:58');
